{
  "about": "Fee and margin cases run by the Rust and Python tests. kind=prd is a PRD acceptance case; kind=derived is computed by hand from a documented rule and documented values (the source page does not print the number); kind=published is a number the source page prints. A case with expect_error cannot run as the PRD wrote it, and records why.",
  "cases": [
